---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — Haidar System" description="Start a useful conversation with Haidar System about a real workflow problem, system, collaboration, or opportunity.">
  <section class="wrap page" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-title" id="contact-title">Bring a real problem.</h1>
    <p class="lead">A useful first message explains the situation, who experiences it, what currently happens, and what action you hope to make easier.</p>
    <ul class="prompt-list">
      <li>I have a real business or workflow problem.</li>
      <li>I want to explore an automation or AI system.</li>
      <li>I want to discuss collaboration.</li>
      <li>I have an opportunity worth investigating.</li>
    </ul>
    <aside class="contact-note" aria-label="Contact availability">
      <p>No verified public contact address is configured in this repository yet. Until one is added, you can review the <a href="https://github.com/haidarsystems/Haidarsystemhq">Haidar System repository</a> and its public project history.</p>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
